evaluations.abstract:
Non-score verification eval supporting the rigorous Pinney-only full-circle convergence theorem (T1b
revision). Tests three pre-registered analytic predictions for the Pinney/Ermakov family
kappa_Q=1/(sqrt(1+Q^2)-Q cos 2s): (i) the low-mode value at the cap center decays as O(Q^{-1/2});
(ii) the Neumann bracket low eigenvalues at the cap centers RISE to the SAME Dirichlet tower {k^2-1}
as the Dirichlet bracket (D-N gap -> 0 per level); (iii) half-cap L2 mass of low modes decays to 0.
